  "mechanicBasicsTitle": "HOW TO PLAY",
  "mechanicBasicsHeadline": "Pick tubes, pour liquid",
  "mechanicBasicsBody": "Tap a tube to select its top color. Then tap a target tube — matching colors can stack, or pour into an empty tube.",
