  "mechanicHiddenTip": "Don't pour blind — clear the top first, reveal below, then decide.",
  "mechanicHiddenCaption": "Top clear • lower foggy",
  "mechanicMixTitle": "COLOR MIXING",
  "mechanicMixHeadline": "Two colors combine into a new one",
